  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Paraguay Programme Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project fund will facilitate two or more partner meetings in Paraguay between CAFOD and existing partners over the course of 2008/9 in order to develop our existing work in Paraguay into a programme. We will be able to undertake and external evaluation of partners and also undertake audits where necessary. This fund will also allow us to meet with potential new partners, who may fit with the new programme, and link these new partners with our existing partners.  This will allow CAFOD to build on the networking that is occurring between our current partners in order that CAFOD and partners can work better together to produce a coherent and effectively functioning programme in the country.  These meetings and the development of a programme will complement the development of the CAFOD CSP for Paraguay.</narrative>
  </description>
